{
    "title": "Bounty Bash",
    "description": "Ahoy, matey! Set sail for adventure in Bounty Bash, the most unique and thrilling Idle Pirate RPG! Dive into a world where your boat and crew grow stronger with every battle, every treasure, and every storm they weather.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Idle Pirate RPG Adventure\r\nEmbark on a grand adventure with your pirate crew, exploring uncharted waters and battling fierce enemies! Your boat continues to bring loot even when you're not playing, making for infinite growth.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0a Spectacular Combat at Sea\r\nWitness battles come to life with a barrage of projectiles, dazzling skills, and awe-inspiring ultimates. With Bounty Bash, the combat is an ocean spectacle that you won't want to miss!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea2 Set Sail and Conquer \u2013 Automatically\r\nYour boat and heroes are always on the lookout for a good fight. With the auto-battle system, they will take on enemies, bosses, and legendary monsters on their own, even when you're off the map!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Customize Your Pirate Dream\r\nA treasure trove of heroes, equipment, and boat parts await you in Bounty Bash. Collect and upgrade your crew and ship to become the most feared pirate on all horizons.\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f Epic RPG Adventure Battles\r\nIn Bounty Bash, every battle is an adventure. Take on otherworldly creatures, rival pirates, and mythical beasts in your quest for treasure and glory!\r\n\r\nWhy Play Bounty Bash?\r\n- Non-Stop Growth: With our infinite growth RPG elements, there's always a new horizon to conquer, a new upgrade to unlock, and a new ally to recruit.\r\n- Auto-Battle System: Let your heroes and boat fight on their own and bring a bounty of riches and progress.\r\n- Massive Collection: With an expansive variety of heroes, equipment, and boat parts, the strategies are endless.\r\n- Stunning Visuals: Experience the high seas like never before with gorgeous graphics and fluid animations.\r\n- Engaging Content: Regular updates bring new quests, features, and content to the ever-expanding world of Bounty Bash!\r\n\r\nSet a course for adventure and riches in Bounty Bash: Idle Pirate RPG. Download now and let your pirate legend begin!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ahoy, matey! Set sail for adventure in Bounty Bash, the most unique and thrilling Idle Pirate RPG! Dive into a world where your boat and crew grow stronger with every battle, every treasure, and every storm they weather.<br><br>Key Features:<br>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Idle Pirate RPG Adventure<br>Embark on a grand adventure with your pirate crew, exploring uncharted waters and battling fierce enemies! Your boat continues to bring loot even when you&#39;re not playing, making for infinite growth.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0a Spectacular Combat at Sea<br>Witness battles come to life with a barrage of projectiles, dazzling skills, and awe-inspiring ultimates. With Bounty Bash, the combat is an ocean spectacle that you won&#39;t want to miss!<br><br>\ud83d\udea2 Set Sail and Conquer \u2013 Automatically<br>Your boat and heroes are always on the lookout for a good fight. With the auto-battle system, they will take on enemies, bosses, and legendary monsters on their own, even when you&#39;re off the map!<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Customize Your Pirate Dream<br>A treasure trove of heroes, equipment, and boat parts await you in Bounty Bash. Collect and upgrade your crew and ship to become the most feared pirate on all horizons.<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f Epic RPG Adventure Battles<br>In Bounty Bash, every battle is an adventure. Take on otherworldly creatures, rival pirates, and mythical beasts in your quest for treasure and glory!<br><br>Why Play Bounty Bash?<br>- Non-Stop Growth: With our infinite growth RPG elements, there&#39;s always a new horizon to conquer, a new upgrade to unlock, and a new ally to recruit.<br>- Auto-Battle System: Let your heroes and boat fight on their own and bring a bounty of riches and progress.<br>- Massive Collection: With an expansive variety of heroes, equipment, and boat parts, the strategies are endless.<br>- Stunning Visuals: Experience the high seas like never before with gorgeous graphics and fluid animations.<br>- Engaging Content: Regular updates bring new quests, features, and content to the ever-expanding world of Bounty Bash!<br><br>Set a course for adventure and riches in Bounty Bash: Idle Pirate RPG. Download now and let your pirate legend begin!",
